{"displayStem":"강체 원통의 층류 모형에서 길이·점도를 고정했다. 반지름을 조절한 두 조건의 압력차와 유량을 비교하였다. 실제 변형 기도의 난류 예측식으로 사용하지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 합성 자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C09 c09-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c09-graph\"><figure class=\"c09-panel\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 345\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"압력차 (cmH₂O)에 따른 유량 (mL/s)\"><style>text{font:17px 'Noto Sans CJK KR',sans-serif}</style><text x=\"15\" y=\"24\">유량 (mL/s)</text><path d=\"M65 50h20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></path><text x=\"90\" y=\"56\">가</text><path d=\"M190 50h20\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></path><text x=\"215\" y=\"56\">나</text><path d=\"M66 78V263H431\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path><path d=\"M66 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M248.5 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"248.5\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8.0</text><path d=\"M431 263v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"431\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">16</text><path d=\"M61 263h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M61 170.5h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"175.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">80</text><path d=\"M61 78h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"57\" y=\"83\" text-anchor=\"end\">160</text><polyline points=\"66,263 157.25,216.75 248.5,170.5 339.75,124.25 431,78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"263\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"157.25\" cy=\"216.75\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"248.5\" cy=\"170.5\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"339.75\" cy=\"124.25\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"431\" cy=\"78\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"black\"></circle><polyline points=\"66,